        <mxCell id="n69" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read.&lt;/b&gt; Each tile is one product or component. Pills carry a status: &lt;b&gt;GA&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;PREVIEW&lt;/b&gt; = Microsoft service maturity; &lt;b&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;OPTIONAL&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;OPT-IN&lt;/b&gt; = how this demo uses it; &lt;b&gt;LIVE-TESTED&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;STATIC-ONLY&lt;/b&gt; = how it was validated. Dashed tiles are optional. A tile with no pill makes no status claim." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#201F1E;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#C8A400;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;spacingLeft=44;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1225" width="1660" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
